  "description": "Montes is a refined, timeless serif typeface that effortlessly balances elegance with a distinctive, high-end editorial feel. As a multi-weight font featuring variable support and included italic styles, it offers exceptional versatility for modern branding, luxury packaging, and editorial layouts. The clean line structure combined with classic serif details gives it a sophisticated yet contemporary character, making it an excellent choice for projects that require a premium and stylish visual identity.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Montes is a refined, timeless serif typeface that effortlessly balances elegance with a distinctive, high-end editorial feel. As a multi-weight font featuring variable support and included italic styles, it offers exceptional versatility for modern branding, luxury packaging, and editorial layouts. The clean line structure combined with classic serif details gives it a sophisticated yet contemporary character, making it an excellent choice for projects that require a premium and stylish visual identity.</p>",
